{
  "mark.2.p1.b1": {
    "text": "过了些日子，耶稣又进了迦百农。人听见他在房子里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "过了些日⁠子，耶⁠稣又⁠进了迦⁠百⁠农。人听⁠见他⁠在房⁠子里，"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b2": {
    "text": "就有许多人聚集，甚至连门前都没有空地；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠有许⁠多人聚⁠集，甚⁠至连门⁠前都⁠没⁠有空⁠地；"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣就对他们讲道。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就对他⁠们讲⁠道。"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b4": {
    "text": "有人带着一个瘫子来见耶稣，是用四个人抬来的；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人带着一⁠个瘫⁠子来⁠见耶⁠稣，是⁠用四个⁠人抬⁠来的；"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b1": {
    "text": "因为人多，不得近前，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为人多，不⁠得近前，"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b2": {
    "text": "就把耶稣所在的房子，拆了房顶，既拆通了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠把耶⁠稣所⁠在的房⁠子，拆了房⁠顶，既拆通了，"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b3": {
    "text": "就把瘫子连所躺卧的褥子都缒下来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠把瘫⁠子连所躺卧的褥⁠子都缒下⁠来。"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b4": {
    "text": "耶稣见他们的信心，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣见他⁠们的信⁠心，"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b5": {
    "text": "就对瘫子说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就对瘫⁠子说："
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b6": {
    "text": "小子，你的罪赦了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "小⁠子，你⁠的罪赦了。"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b1": {
    "text": "有几个文士坐在那里，心里议论，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有几⁠个文⁠士坐⁠在那⁠里，心⁠里议⁠论，说："
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b2": {
    "text": "这个人为什么这样说呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠个人为⁠什⁠么这⁠样说呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b3": {
    "text": "他说僭妄的话了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他说僭妄的⁠话了。"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b4": {
    "text": "除了神以外，谁能赦罪呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "除⁠了神以⁠外，谁⁠能赦⁠罪呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b5": {
    "text": "耶稣心中知道他们心里这样议论，就说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣心⁠中知⁠道他⁠们心⁠里这⁠样议⁠论，就说："
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b6": {
    "text": "你们心里为什么这样议论呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们心⁠里为⁠什⁠么这⁠样议⁠论呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b7": {
    "text": "或对瘫子说「你的罪赦了」，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "或对瘫⁠子说「你⁠的罪赦了」，"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b8": {
    "text": "或说「起来！拿你的褥子行走」，哪一样容易呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "或说「起⁠来！拿你⁠的褥⁠子行⁠走」，哪一⁠样容⁠易呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b1": {
    "text": "但要叫你们知道，人子在地上有赦罪的权柄。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但要叫你⁠们知⁠道，人⁠子在地⁠上有赦⁠罪的权⁠柄。"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b2": {
    "text": "就对瘫子说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就对瘫⁠子说："
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b3": {
    "text": "我吩咐你，起来！拿你的褥子回家去吧。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我吩⁠咐你，起⁠来！拿你⁠的褥⁠子回⁠家去吧。"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b4": {
    "text": "那人就起来，立刻拿着褥子，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那人就起⁠来，立⁠刻拿着褥⁠子，"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b5": {
    "text": "当众人面前出去了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "当⁠众人面⁠前出⁠去了，"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b6": {
    "text": "以致众人都惊奇，归荣耀与神，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "以⁠致众⁠人都惊⁠奇，归荣⁠耀与神，说："
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b7": {
    "text": "我们从来没有见过这样的事！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们从⁠来没⁠有见⁠过这⁠样的事！"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣经过的时候，看见亚勒腓的儿子利未坐在税关上，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣经⁠过的时⁠候，看⁠见亚⁠勒⁠腓的儿⁠子利⁠未坐⁠在税关上，"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b2": {
    "text": "你跟从我来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你跟从我⁠来。"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b3": {
    "text": "他就起来，跟从了耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他就起⁠来，跟从了耶⁠稣。"
  },
  "mark.2.p6.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣在利未家里坐席的时候，有好些税吏和罪人与耶稣并门徒一同坐席；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣在利⁠未家⁠里坐⁠席的时⁠候，有好⁠些税⁠吏和罪⁠人与耶⁠稣并门⁠徒一⁠同坐⁠席；"
  },
  "mark.2.p6.b2": {
    "text": "法利赛人中的文士看见耶稣和罪人并税吏一同吃饭，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "法⁠利⁠赛人中⁠的文⁠士看⁠见耶⁠稣和罪⁠人并税⁠吏一⁠同吃⁠饭，"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b1": {
    "text": "他和税吏并罪人一同吃喝吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他和税⁠吏并罪⁠人一⁠同吃⁠喝吗？"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b2": {
    "text": "康健的人用不着医生，有病的人才用得着。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "康⁠健的人用⁠不⁠着医⁠生，有⁠病的人⁠才用得着。"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b3": {
    "text": "我来本不是召义人，乃是召罪人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠来本不⁠是召义人，乃⁠是召罪⁠人。"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b1": {
    "text": "当下，约翰的门徒和法利赛人禁食。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "当⁠下，约⁠翰的门⁠徒和法⁠利⁠赛人禁⁠食。"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b2": {
    "text": "约翰的门徒和法利赛人的门徒禁食，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠翰的门⁠徒和法⁠利⁠赛人的门⁠徒禁⁠食，"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b3": {
    "text": "你的门徒倒不禁食，这是为什么呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠的门⁠徒倒不⁠禁食，这是为⁠什⁠么呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b1": {
    "text": "新郎和陪伴之人同在的时候，陪伴之人岂能禁食呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "新⁠郎和陪⁠伴之人同在的时⁠候，陪⁠伴之人岂能禁⁠食呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b2": {
    "text": "但日子将到，新郎要离开他们，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但日⁠子将到，新⁠郎要离⁠开他⁠们，"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b3": {
    "text": "那日他们就要禁食。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那日他⁠们就⁠要禁⁠食。"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b1": {
    "text": "没有人把新布缝在旧衣服上，……破的就更大了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "没⁠有人把新布缝⁠在旧衣⁠服上，……破的就更⁠大了。"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b2": {
    "text": "也没有人把新酒装在旧皮袋里，……酒和皮袋就都坏了；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "也⁠没⁠有人把新⁠酒装在旧皮⁠袋里，……酒和皮⁠袋就都坏了；"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b3": {
    "text": "惟把新酒装在新皮袋里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "惟把新⁠酒装在新皮⁠袋里。"
  },
  "mark.2.p11.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣当安息日从麦地经过。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣当安⁠息⁠日从麦地经⁠过。"
  },
  "mark.2.p11.b2": {
    "text": "看哪，他们在安息日为什么做不可做的事呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "看哪，他⁠们在安⁠息⁠日为⁠什⁠么做不⁠可做⁠的事呢？"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b1": {
    "text": "经上记着大卫和跟从他的人缺乏饥饿之时所做的事，你们没有念过吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "经上记着大⁠卫和跟从他⁠的人缺⁠乏饥⁠饿之时所做⁠的事，你⁠们没⁠有念⁠过吗？"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b2": {
    "text": "他……怎么进了神的殿，吃了陈设饼，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他……怎⁠么进了神的殿，吃⁠了陈⁠设饼，"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b3": {
    "text": "又给跟从他的人吃。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又给跟从他⁠的人吃。"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b4": {
    "text": "这饼除了祭司以外，人都不可吃。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这饼除⁠了祭⁠司以⁠外，人都不⁠可吃。"
  },
  "mark.2.p13.b1": {
    "text": "安息日是为人设立的，人不是为安息日设立的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "安⁠息⁠日是为⁠人设⁠立的，人不⁠是为安⁠息⁠日设⁠立的。"
  },
  "mark.2.p13.b2": {
    "text": "所以，人子也是安息日的主。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 2:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "所⁠以，人⁠子也⁠是安⁠息⁠日的主。"
  }
}
